<title>USA: MBIA plans equity and debt offerings.</title>
<headline>MBIA plans equity and debt offerings.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Inc said Thursday it plans offerings of a million shares of common stock and $100 million of debt.</p>
<p>The underwriters have an option to buy up to 150,000 additional common shares to cover over-allotments, MBIA said.</p>
<p>MBIA said it will use proceeds of the offerings to support its future needs and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
